<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8" data-next-head=""/><script type="text/javascript" src="https://content.citivelocity.com/CitigroupUI/historical-lookup/aknetpublic/historical-lookup.js" id="" data-next-head=""></script><link href="https://content.citivelocity.com/CitigroupUI/citigpa-20260123/aknetpublic/citigpa.min.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet" data-next-head=""/><link href="https://content.citivelocity.com/CitigroupUI/citigpa-fonts-20241023/aknetpublic/Fonts.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet" data-next-head=""/><link href="https://content.citivelocity.com/CitigroupUI/citigpa-template-20250228/aknetpublic/template.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet" data-next-head=""/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no" data-next-head=""/><meta name="robots" content="all" data-next-head=""/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.citigroup.com/global/about-us/global-presence/india" data-next-head=""/><link rel="icon" href="/global/citigroup-ui/akpublic/images/gpa_favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" data-next-head=""/><link rel="shortcut icon" href="/global/citigroup-ui/akpublic/images/gpa_favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" data-next-head=""/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/global/citigroup-ui/akpublic/libs/font/font.css?t=20231122" data-next-head=""/><link rel="stylesheet" as="style" href="/global/repoComponent/akpublic/GpaMenu/component/GpaMenu.css?t=bb0d311ff94c77e231dcb3d09f6b6a07" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:title" content="India | Citi Global Presence" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:description" content="Committed to India for over 120 years, Citi takes pride in being a premier locally embedded financial institution, backed by an unmatched global network. Citi is an employer of choice in India, offering institutions a broad range of financial products and services, including corporate and investment banking, brokerage, treasury and trade services, securities and fund services. In line with our commitment to make a positive difference in the communities we work, Citi India&#x27;s citizenship program targets its strategic efforts in the priority areas of Financial Capability &amp; Asset Building, Microfinance, Enterprise Development and Youth, Education &amp; Livelihoods." data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/media/citigpa/akpublic/storage/retrieveMediaFile/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg" data-next-head=""/><title data-next-head="">India | Citi Global Presence</title><meta name="description" content="Committed to India for over 120 years, Citi takes pride in being a premier locally embedded financial institution, backed by an unmatched global network. Citi is an employer of choice in India, offering institutions a broad range of financial products and services, including corporate and investment banking, brokerage, treasury and trade services, securities and fund services. In line with our commitment to make a positive difference in the communities we work, Citi India&#x27;s citizenship program targets its strategic efforts in the priority areas of Financial Capability &amp; Asset Building, Microfinance, Enterprise Development and Youth, Education &amp; Livelihoods." data-next-head=""/><meta name="image" content="https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/media/citigpa/akpublic/storage/retrieveMediaFile/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.citigroup.com/global/about-us/global-presence/india" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:type" content="website" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:title" content="India | Citi Global Presence" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:url" content="https://www.citigroup.com/global/about-us/global-presence/india" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Committed to India for over 120 years, Citi takes pride in being a premier locally embedded financial institution, backed by an unmatched global network. Citi is an employer of choice in India, offering institutions a broad range of financial products and services, including corporate and investment banking, brokerage, treasury and trade services, securities and fund services. In line with our commitment to make a positive difference in the communities we work, Citi India&#x27;s citizenship program targets its strategic efforts in the priority areas of Financial Capability &amp; Asset Building, Microfinance, Enterprise Development and Youth, Education &amp; Livelihoods." data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/media/citigpa/akpublic/storage/retrieveMediaFile/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg" data-next-head=""/><meta name="keywords" content="investment bank, financial services, global banking, global finance" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" as="image" imageSrcSet="https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 640w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 750w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 828w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 1080w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 1200w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 1920w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 2048w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 3840w" imageSizes="100vw" data-next-head=""/><link rel="stylesheet" as="style" href="/global/repoComponent/akpublic/GpaLocationDetail/component/GpaLocationDetail.css?t=bb0d311ff94c77e231dcb3d09f6b6a07" data-next-head=""/><link rel="stylesheet" as="style" href="/global/repoComponent/akpublic/Spacer/component/Spacer.css?