le="img" aria-label="search" class="searchIcon___xA-25 lmnicon lmnicon-search"></i></div><div id="searchPopup" class="gpaMenuPopup___glIBi"></div></div><div class="lmn-border-color-0 divider___jd8v1"></div><div><div class="lmn-popover-trigger"><div role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" class="lmn-text-color-0 myAccount___XG4Ld">My Account</div><div id="accountPopup" class="gpaMenuPopup___glIBi"></div></div></div></div><div class="searchAndMenu___pif45"><i role="img" aria-label="search" tabindex="0" aria-hidden="false" class="searchIcon___xA-25 firstIcon___Q4vpZ lmnicon lmnicon-search"></i><i role="img" aria-label="menu" tabindex="0" class="menuIcon___KbIFZ lmnicon lmnicon-menu"></i></div></div><div></div></div><div id="popup" class="gpaMenuPopup___glIBi"></div><div class="gpaMenuContent___nyWKA"></div><!--/$--></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Grid en-US ck-content"><div style="max-width:3132px;margin:auto"><div class="GridRow  responsiveGridRow" id="" style="background:#fff"><div class="lmn-container container-custom" style="max-width:100%"><div class="lmn-row  "><div class="lmn-col-lg-12 portlet" style="padding:0px" id="GpaLocationDetail00"><!--$--><div class="GpaLocationDetail___O250P"><div dir="ltr" class="LocationDetail___QpmCL"><nav aria-label="breadcrumb"><ol class="citigroup-container-center breadCrumb___Ky1SF"><li><a class="lmn-font-size-xs item___FtLQ7 BreadCrumbLink___Z1tAi" href="/global" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true" class="splitLine___x5ueQ">/</span></li><li><a class="lmn-font-size-xs item___FtLQ7 BreadCrumbLink___Z1tAi" href="/global/about-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">About Us</a><span aria-hidden="true" class="splitLine___x5ueQ">/</span></li><li><a class="lmn-font-size-xs item___FtLQ7 BreadCrumbLink___Z1tAi" href="/global/about-us/global-presence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Global Presence</a><span aria-hidden="true" class="splitLine___x5ueQ">/</span></li><li><a class="lmn-text-color-0 lmn-font-size-xs item___FtLQ7 noHover___zMj-2 BreadCrumbLink___Z1tAi lastBreadCrumb___76qUg" aria-current="location" tabindex="-1" rel="noopener noreferrer">India</a></li></ol></nav><div><div class="heroImage___GqQnG"><div class="citigroup-container-hero-center citigroup-animatedFadeInUp  GpaThirdLevelHero___74geS"><div class="heroContent___LFEiS"><div class="bannerImage___lfsE0 bannerImageBefore___VeLmt"><img alt="" itemprop="image" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 640w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 750w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 828w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 1080w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 1200w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 1920w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 2048w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg 3840w" src="https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/6388805dc1e1712cc61bcfff.jpg"/></div><h1 id="" class="lmn-text-color-inverse-0 lmn-font-weight-bold title___KERbd">India</h1></div></div></div><div class="lmn-text-color-0 citigroup-container-center locationBody___38ftc"><div class="titleArea___saSkT containerArea___+FgB2"><div id="notice" class="noticeItem___hYXlp collapsed___zoBST"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," aria-label="information icon" class="InfoIcon___U-tkF"/><div style="cursor:pointer" aria-label="Expand Migration to &#x27;.bank.in&#x27; domain" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" role="link" class="noticeHeader___OJJen"><h2 class="lmn-font-overpass-bold citigroup-h5 noticeTitle___EPYJK">Migration to &#x27;.bank.in&#x27; domain: </h2><div class="lmn-font-size-lg citigroup-theme-citi-blue previewText___LNtPe"><p><i data-olk-copy-source="MailCompose"><span>Dear Customer,</span></i></p><p><i><span>This is with reference to the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) circular - Migration to '.bank.in' domain (dated Apr 22, 2025) to enhance security and trust in digital banking. In reference to the same, we wish to update you that the Bank is currently in the process of migrating its website and applications to the ‘.bank.in’ domain.</span></i></p><p><i><span><strong>What does this mean for you –</strong></span></i></p><ol start="1"><li class="ck-list-marker-italic" data-list-item-id="ea439594a6a9bef7c985451ecbd9899f2"><i><span role="presentation">Until the migration is complete, <strong>it is crucial that you ONLY use</strong>&nbsp;the verified links provided below for all your banking needs. Please ensure you always access our services through these official channels to maintain the security of your account.'</span></i><ol><li data-list-item-id="e4aacd035a78fc8ea6837a2e5b8d7ce71">CitiDirect <a href="https://www.citidirect.com/">https://www.citidirect.com/</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e44957574597c918d5ed3055155ff1f13">CitiFX Pulse <a href="https://www.citifxpulse.com">https://www.citifxpulse.com</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e9b19120fb68179290d57c2b5e365659c">CitiDirect Mobile <a href="https://m.citidirect.com/">https://m.citidirect.com/</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e0eff3aa503b36aab170cd83ce92f8b3e">Citi Velocity <a href="https://www.citivelocity.com">https://www.citivelocity.com</a></li><li data-list-item-id="eeef74157fe249a826bfcbbb9eadfa90d">Citi Manager <a href="https://home.cards.citidirect.citi.bank.in/CommercialCard/login">https://home.cards.citidirect.citi.bank.in/CommercialCard/login</a></li><li data-list-item-id="eaff8c34ed6d385030e153ce2cf776160">CDCB<ol><li data-list-item-id="e1ce16a26522427e607516bc35910da95">For Digital Onboarding: <a href="https://commercialbanking.citidirect.com/">https://commercialbanking.citidirect.com/</a></li><li data-list-item-id="ec7c09163166aa68fb0ff3ecfa9146f3d">For Everyday Banking: <a href="https://citidirect.com/commercialbanking">https://citidirect.com/commercialbanking</a></li></ol></li><li data-list-item-id="edec11f4d1cbf52d360a86d56605017a6">Corporate website <a href="https://www.citigroup.com/global/about-us/global-presence/india">https://www.citigroup.com/global/about-us/global-presence/india</a></li><li data-list-item-id="e637e700d530e402e6bfde345ad90e226">SFTS <a href="https://webui.filetransfer.com">https://webui.filetransfer.com</a></li></ol></li><li class="ck-list-marker-italic" data-list-item-id="e2d8d0feccd504b738a09fedab4333c8a"><i><span role="presentation">Your Internet Banking login ID and password remain the same.</span></i></li><li class="ck-list-marker-italic" data-list-item-id="e76758776040c2e6a374642366b4ddc6c"><i><span role="presentation">For any queries, please reach out to your Customer Service/ Relationship Managers.</span></i></li></ol><p><i><span>Upon successful migration by the Bank to the ‘<strong>.bank.in</strong>’ domain, we will reach out to you again with the revised links to the website and applications.</span></i></p></div><img id="toggleImg" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," aria-label="Expand Migration to &#x27;.bank.in&#x27; domain" class="ToggleIcon___4aYJk collapsed___zoBST"/></div></div><h2 class="citigroup-h1 title___c7Klk" id="subTitle">Our local expertise</h2><div id="summary" class="citigroup-h5 summary___iwTwc">Committed to India for over 120 years, Citi takes pride in being a premier locally embedded financial institution, backed by an unmatched global network. Citi is an employer of choice in India, offering institutions a broad range of financial products and services, including corporate and investment banking, brokerage, treasury and trade services, securities and fund services. In line with our commitment to make a positive difference in the communities we work, Citi India's citizenship program targets its strategic efforts in the priority areas of Financial Capability & Asset Building, Microfinance, Enterprise Development and Youth, Education & Livelihoods.</div><div id="leadership" class="leadership___SAUPS"><h2 id="" class="titleItem___nmZCW leadershipTitle___ALfqP">Country Leadership</h2><div class="leadshipContainer___dhj4C"><div class="leadershipItem___C5YNt"><div class="peronalImage___IWh3d"><img alt="" itemprop="image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/67f537227926f351d38d6578.jpg 640w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/67f537227926f351d38d6578.jpg 750w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/67f537227926f351d38d6578.jpg 828w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/67f537227926f351d38d6578.jpg 1080w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/67f537227926f351d38d6578.jpg 1200w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/67f537227926f351d38d6578.jpg 1920w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/67f537227926f351d38d6578.jpg 2048w, https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/67f537227926f351d38d6578.jpg 3840w" src="https://www.citigroup.com/rcs/v1/siteIds/citigpa/asset/67f537227926f351d38d6578.jpg"/></div><div class="peronalInfo___pbiI4"><div class="lmn-font-size-xl personName___N4Vyh">K Balasubramanian</div><div class="lmn-font-size-md personJob___z3dw7">India Subcontinent Sub-Cluster &amp; Banking Head and India CEO &amp; Banking Head</div><div class="shareIcons___BPsVy"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bodyRight___6D0aM"><div style="display:block" class="mediaArea___bl