port FY 2023-2024\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e979f932fbc997272e8c9879904749aa8\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/regulatory-disclosures/csr-impact-assessment-fy22-23-fy23-24.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCSR Impact Assessment Report FY22-23 and FY23-24\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ec6dde0069f85b0faaaf636adf7abdd04\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/regulatory-disclosures/citibank-na-csr-policy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCitibank N.A. CSR Policy\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e0b3ba7cf073b7403aac0c68be7573538\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/regulatory-disclosures/cbna-annual-action-plan-fy23-24.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCBNA’s Annual Action Plan FY23-24\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e1a228b89b599a348749f5159f4e46aaa\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/regulatory-disclosures/cbna-annual-action-plan-fy25-26.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCitibank N.A. Annual Action Plan for FY25-26\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-size:20px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStandard Loan Agreements\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ea4d20c7f0ef154f1725e3f360a03fc95\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/regulatory-disclosures/working-capital-facility-agreement.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eWorking Capital Facility Agreement\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e51baab3e31133b824bfd7ea01b567061\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/regulatory-disclosures/working-capital-facility-agreement-cb.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eWorking Capital Facility Agreement - Corporate Banking\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee666ac7f165f51ddd00317cf7b0c3214\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/regulatory-disclosures/term-loan-facility-agreement.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eTerm Loan Facility Agreement\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eaa9cb1861d7cd826c16b549f53a7c429\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/regulatory-disclosures/amendatory-agreement.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eAmendatory Agreement\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e6966855e2a95a688deceab5cc94814a2\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/regulatory-disclosures/secured-assets-possessed-sarfaesi-bank.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSecured Assets possessed under SARFAESI by the Bank\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eeb16d824ee9c759361b30fee58d113dc\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/exited-outsrc-arrgmnts.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eExited Outsourcing Arrangements\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e"},{"title":"Legacy Consumer Business","type":"richText","file":[{"title":""}],"richText":"\u003cp\u003eCiti India has transferred ownership of its consumer banking business to Axis Bank. Please contact Axis Bank for more information about your accounts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor any concerns or questions relating to your closed bank accounts, credit cards and loans which were not transferred to Axis Bank, you may send an e-mail to \u003ca href=\"mailto:serviceindia@citi.com\"\u003eserviceindia@citi.com\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you are not satisfied with the response received from Citi, you may escalate your concern by writing to \u003ca href=\"mailto:priorityserviceindia@citi.com\"\u003epriorityserviceindia@citi.com\u003c/a\u003e. Please ensure you quote the reference number from your previous interaction with us, while reaching out to the \u003ca href=\"mailto:priorityserviceindia@citi.com\"\u003epriorityserviceindia@citi.com\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ea0222cd07ba685444316cb28a59bcf5f\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/legacy-consumer-business/refund-processing-guide.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eRefund Processing Guide\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ef6a7c6d4c3cd0fa610b45fd900974aa7\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/legacy-consumer-business/fund-transfer-instruction-form.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eFund Transfer Instruction Form\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e49d5dd110d7594a082e1a6fd77c250e2\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/legacy-consumer-business/reclaim-from-deaf.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eReclaim from DEAF\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e9bba7600d18c74313df2308032b73033\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/legacy-consumer-business/signature-change-form.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eSignature Change Form\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e1b39227bb565f2cd35703f811af14489\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/legacy-consumer-business/indemnity-form.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eIndemnity Form\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-size:20px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnnexures for Deceased Claim\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e7c150c84f4435377d53f256a68c9d02b\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/legacy-consumer-business/annex-1-a.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eAnnex I-A\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e6dc67d1b1930c3707a834beef76333e0\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/r