 DP/Account Opening \u0026amp; Complaint filing Steps\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:20px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e72b33df2b8526e02c4084a528044af35\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/sop-granular-reporting.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eSOP for seeking additional disclosures from certain objectively identified Foreign Portfolio Investors (FPIs) framed by the DDPs, Custodians, Depositories and Exchanges, in consultation with SEBI, for implementation of the SEBI circular\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ecd25074bbfead8f1e7927fcc06a799cb\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSEBI/HO/AFD/AFD-PoD-2/CIR/P/2023/148 issued on August 24, 2023. (Updated SOP as of 22ndMay 2024) \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"eff83459a0779a04497a37636c8949628\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/securities-services.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDetails of Various Services Charges\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ef12e5cf4baf41db1b938c7a6695933ff\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/reporting-formats.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eSEBI Reporting formats for below reports\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ec2129e8d7121136e09a6496fdf25efeb\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/sop-fpi-registration.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eStandard Operation Procedures (SOP) for FPI Registration\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ed67238b9b5f04b47be2da12594d2c5bf\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/fpi-india-access-pack.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eFPI India Access Pack\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e3439ccd007f8ba20ffdf4bb3f470599f\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/financial-results/caf-annexure-to-caf.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eCommon Application Form (CAF) \u0026amp; Annexure to CAF\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e2768c8e2fbfb4aa9b287677850780795\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/financial-results/cover-letter-document-legal-entity.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eCover Letter and Document for Legal Entity\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e5d20fef1d8ca9288db9c60743f9a83ec\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/financial-results/declaration-additional-disclosures.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDeclaration for additional disclosures\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e73ca5c6bfe9b9f0edd24ef3c37a398d1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/facility-clients-kyc-status-kra-website.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eFacility for clients to view their KYC Status on KRA Website(s)\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-size:20px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComplaints Status \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e5e1efdea5802adb2df850a5bbf86b980\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/financial-results/complaints-against-custodians-sebi.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSEBI : Complaints against Custodians\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e84243b7a18b50eb40cc3d2b66f552a54\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/financial-results/Complaints-against-custodians-and-designated-depository-participants-nsdl.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eNSDL/CDSL : Complaints against Depository Participant (DP)\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e5b18efb0e4f0b22b60e05abbd06003a9\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/financial-results/complaints-against-designated-depository-participants-sebi.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSEBI : Complaints against Designated Depository Participants (DDPs)\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-size:20px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eINVESTOR CHARTER\u003c/strong\u003e \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e566e14b6f17bc4b2b4997048ea4c47d9\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/financial-results/Investor-charter-custodians-designated-depository-participants.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eInvestor Charter for Custodians and Designated Depository Participants (DDPs)\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInformation on Nodal Office and Ombudsman:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eIf you are not satisfied with the response received from the Head Customer Care, you may escalate your concern to the Principal Nodal Officer(PNO) in the following ways. Please ensure you quote the reference number from your previous interaction with us, while reaching out to the PNO.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/information-on-nodal-officer.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click here\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eto write instantly to Principal Nodal Officer – Pramodh Antony P\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eWrite to:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003ePrincipal Nodal Officer,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003ePramodh Antony P\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eCitibank N.A.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e163, Anna Salai Branch\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eMount Road\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eChennai – 600 002.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eDo not forget to quote your interaction reference number and first point of contact with the bank.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);font-size:20px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNODAL OFFICE CONTACT \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eaccb0af8e04005167322b7248b514020\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/information-on-nodal-officer.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eTTS Branch and Principal Nodal Officer Details\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eec2be01f599a8ec89289f5509cad5626\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/Annex-I-and-II.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eNodal Office Contact Detail\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.citidirect.com/cdhome/client-knowledge-center\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Citi Knowledge Center\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCiti Knowledge Center\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e - Complete information on Products and Platforms, guide to assist account openings and account maintenances across various geographies to review documentation and visibility to Country Variances \u0026amp; Digital Solutions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e9dbc7e9dd88c7898d8162979500cae9e\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://paisaboltahai.rbi.org.in/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Design and security features of all bank notes\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDesign and security features of all bank notes\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e3eb0b3e836a4d72d3450acd757f97117\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/cfil/customer-facilitation-centre.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eCustomer Facilitation Centre\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"eebf7a565198579e99bc006eb4cb308bb\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/exchange-notes-coins-citibank.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eFacility for Exchange of Notes, Coins, Soiled \u0026amp; Mutilated Notes at Citibank Branches\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e"},{"file":[{"title":""}],"title":"Custody Services","type":"richText","richText":"\u003cp\u003eDirect Custody and Clearing provides asset servicing and transaction functions primarily to intermediaries such as broker-dealers, banks, fund managers, insurance companies and other global investors through our proprietary network in over 60 markets. The scale of this network, provided through our own offices and staffed with Citi experts in each market, sets Citi apart from the competition.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustody and Clearing delivers the highest standards of technology and processes, as well as a level of expertise, quality and consistency that is unmatched. Additionally, the market knowledge and relationships created by such a widespread local presence enable Citi to develop new industry solutions and help lead the process of change in the securities marketplace\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe, Citibank N.A., are registered Custodian and Designated Depository Participant (DDP) with Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI). The same can be verified at \u003ca href=\"https://www.sebi.gov.in/sebiweb/other/OtherAction.do?doRecognised=yes\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSEBI Website\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ecae754b6495538412402b09ad986836e\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eScalable Trade Settlement with highest levels of \u003c/strong\u003eStraight-Through Processing (STP)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e608cd17d4bc31ecd53adef7d7baad618\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe solutions offered include\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee783465b9f831b773a7e946b8bbffdd3\"\u003eSafe Keeping\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ec56ddbec603349c641d072d55f02e4e5\"\u003eClearing and Settlement\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e9a5dbf682f6db210858433d1def24ab5\"\u003eComprehensive support for subscriptions to Initial Public Offerings (IPO)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ebedefa966692b339254233d63866e4a2\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/list-of-branches-and-nodal-officer-for-BT.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eList of Branches \u0026amp; Nodal officer for Bankers to an issue\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e4e088bcf2126765ea0450a50d7c2fe97\"\u003eSupport for subscriptions to mutual funds, money market funds, listed open-end and exchange-traded funds\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e621596dcaecfe06fb0748d3437a17a6f\"\u003eRobust corporate actions functionality, leveraging Citi system enhancements\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e5a59e397f850417aecd431d8184d650e\"\u003eLocal custodian for American Depositary Receipts (ADR) and Global Depositary Receipts (GDR)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e9621718a74ea445cfcf5b200c2e31278\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProxy Voting Services\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e27f758e2f5daa54d26572690c4510766\"\u003eCareful monitoring of announcement sources\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e4c197fb049080ffeaa6245be467ef073\"\u003eTimely and accurate notification of agenda items\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e843d4737f438a6b56877054e95ade24b\"\u003eFacilitation of voting at general meetings\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e2ae6919bb27f52bac472c06a13edd9bd\"\u003eConfirmation that votes have been submitted\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e63afafbb982dd5d3e32eb46d16f68742\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMarket Information\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe can blend traditional global custody services with domestic direct custody access to markets, to meet your comprehensive and most complex custodial needs, including:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e29c98b44c699ccb667e6b04b0839c8e4\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSafekeeping and settlement:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur high STP rates ensure that your trades settle with a minimum of manual intervention.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e6616d1015bf7ebb846bf8cddf1b5691d\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncome processing and corporate actions:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe provide information to help you manage your cash assets effectively and maximize your investment returns.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eed71c9e0a8c4b9d7007249758b940afc\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecord keeping and reporting:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOur reports give you critical information on your securities and cash positions, along with transaction status.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e4bc91848fdbd96930ddd31dbe1b8287a\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDirect electronic interface:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe have direct interfaces into central depository systems and through CitiVelocity, our Web-based platform for custody and clearing clients.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e88056b77f1161f29ae131693538f8d3b\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnological sophistication:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe deliver an advanced IT infrastructure, processing technologies and rigorous operational controls.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003eCompetitive pricing and best Forex deadlines\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe can execute Forex transactions in 306 currency pairs with innovative pricing solutions, using the RBI benchmark rate for pricing deals. We offer you a dedicated Forex desk with extended coverage time [8:00 AM to 9:30 PM IST] with a capability to quote cash [same day value deals] even post local cut off time by using Citi's prop book.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe existing demat account holders will have the ability to update/modify email ID and / or income range in their demat accounts in an online mode on NSDL web portal viz., \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://eservices.nsdl.com/kyc-attributes/#/login\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003ehttps://eservices.nsdl.com/kyc-attributes/#/login\u003c/u\u003e.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"table\"\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e731a51736bea241367cd26731aa33370\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSEBI Complaints Redress System (SCORES) platform:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e6af8aa64fd943d1f611ec19505b3601b\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eSCORES is a web based centralized system to capture investor complaints against listed companies and registered intermediaries and is available 24x7. Please refer below link of SCORES portal to lodge grievances.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://scores.sebi.gov.in\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ehttps://scores.sebi.gov.in\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e352f78b11077227b8d274889b2ca42b1\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFiling compliant on SCORES – Easy \u0026amp; quick\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003col style=\"list-style-type:lower-latin;\"\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e67afe1b4748214b99d90359387775473\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eRegister on SCORES portal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e0043ae6e534ec2f54381e1914f0a38ed\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eMandatory details for filing complaints on SCORES\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e74d9414ccb256fd6eabda5acbba17efe\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eName, PAN, Address, Mobile Number, E-mail ID\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"ef70be0dd51e966fc5923c207233ffdef\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eBenefits:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e594426a2fe8f1b5924c1217aed2ec649\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eEffective Communication\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e58009795ee8980ee7a15b90901a5a958\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eSpeedy redressal of the grievances\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e2162c4f941f38302ebf4e12d404c1918\"\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInvestor grievances –\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"edcd62717617621dad11831dc3b642de1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eFor Complaints/grievances related to Custody Services;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e4d2c0be5b1358b851e6760886fc8d041\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eEmail -\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:ss.custodygrievances@citi.com\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ess.custodygrievances@citi.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e9b2e0b2200416ffe438e2ed4413c7329\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eFor Complaints/grievances related to Designated Depository Participants (DDP) Services;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"ed2bba6a07e14ff25d9448f9371fdf98d\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eEmail -\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:ss.ddpgrievances@citi.com\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ess.ddpgrievances@citi.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e6851027b5ad1dfbd1ef1bef28ab29a62\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eBelow email ID is created by NSDL for receiving complaints exclusively related to surveillance activities. Clients can lodge their complaints with respect to market manipulation/fraudulent activities in the market or against Depository Participants.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"e376affc99bda2d793b27872d5e71b3c4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eEmail -\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:report-mktmanipulation@nsdl.com\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ereport-mktmanipulation@nsdl.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"eb048dd8cc551deac0729865501583863\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnline Dispute Resolution Portal (“ODR Portal”):\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"ee02ed09b95edef51284dd33a5de49aac\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eAfter exhausting all available options (lodging complaint directly/SCORES Portal) for resolution of the grievance, if the investor/client is still not satisfied with the outcome, he/she/they can initiate dispute resolution through the ODR Portal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"ea2754d4e905c8c06b11aeeba20a73c94\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003ePlease click this\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://smartodr.in/login\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eODR Portal\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eto lodge grievances\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:16px;\" data-list-item-id=\"ed71f4ac6993aa0a4aaa199794118b2a1\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/custody-complaint-escalation-flowchart.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003eClick here\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e for Flowchart for Lodging of Customer Complaints\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eATTENTION INVESTORS\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\"KYC is one time exercise while dealing in securities markets - once KYC is done through a SEBI registered intermediary (broker, DP, Mutual Fund etc.), you need not undergo the same process again when you approach another intermediary.\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\"Prevent Unauthorized Transactions in your demat account --\u0026gt; Update your Mobile Number with your Depository Participant. Receive alerts on your Registered Mobile for all\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003edebit and other important transactions\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003ein your demat account directly from NSDL on the same day......................\u003cstrong\u003eissued in the interest of investors.\u003c/strong\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:16px;\"\u003e\"No need to issue cheques by investors while subscribing to IPO. Just write the bank account number and sign in the application form to authorise your bank to make payment in case of allotment. No worries for refund as the money remains in investor's account.\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eATTENTION INVESTORS\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ef7932373edb482622fbbf95ab7dfa1ae\"\u003eStock Brokers can accept securities as margin from clients only by way of pledge in the depository system w.e.f. September 1, 2020.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e1b3344128ac7b62dc31caba5f84c9561\"\u003eUpdate your mobile number \u0026amp; email Id with your stock broker/depository participant and receive OTP directly from depository on your email id and/or mobile number to create pledge.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e16f0e9f3fef0cf784c1d68390774d67b\"\u003ePay 20% upfront margin of the transaction value to trade in cash market segment.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee499aaa84a799fe30d7148bf0100be6c\"\u003eInvestors may please refer to the Exchange's Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) issued vide circular reference NSE/INSP/45191 dated July 31, 2020 and NSE/INSP/45534 dated August 31, 2020 and other guidelines issued from time to time in this regard.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e071670c46942a795a648f88eb8e928b2\"\u003eCheck your Securities /MF/ Bonds in the consolidated account statement issued by NSDL/CDSL every month. .......... Issued in the interest of Investors.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ebd7c1b854ff298aac346b811bd267064\"\u003eInvestor Grievances escalation matrix –\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/grievances-escalation-matrix-contacts.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eContact Us\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ea07f883ea72b9cd18243f7997e093e93\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/nsdl-demat-account-dos-donts.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eNSDL\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eand\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/csdl-demat-account-dos-donts.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCDSL\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003ecirculars notifying the Do’s and Don’t related to demat account holders.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ea27de38cd0bd12d02c489783a1ad8ffd\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/rights-and-obligations-of-beneficial-owner.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eLearn more about the Rights and Obligations of Beneficial Owner and Depository Participant as prescribed by SEBI and Depositories\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ed5a933df5bb893999b6a1dd2940a0b03\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/common-sop-incapacitated-investor.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eLearn more about Common SOP for operation of accounts incase of an incapacitated investor - Applicable to Depositories and Mutual Funds\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e86074ed091d14f25d023dea1d71adbe8\"\u003eIn order to encourage investors and to make the e-Voting process easier, NSDL also facilitates direct e-voting by investors. The e-Voting platform of NSDL can be accessed by investors through the following link -\u003ca href=\"https://eservices.nsdl.com/\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ehttps://eservices.nsdl.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eor\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.evoting.nsdl.com/\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ehttps://www.evoting.nsdl.com/\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e77adfe790106d81e10fc0b299fcb3a96\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/details-of-dp-account-opening-complaint-filing-steps.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eLearn more about the details of DP/Account Opening \u0026amp; Complaint filing Steps\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e5fc90eb4a0d4a79da46bc1021d417668\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/sop-granular-reporting.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSOP for seeking additional disclosures from certain objectively identified Foreign Portfolio Investors (FPIs) framed CDSSF\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e in consultation with SEBI, for implementation of the SEBI circular SEBI/HO/AFD/AFD-PoD-2/CIR/P/2023/148 issued on August 24, 2023. (Updated SOP as of 21st Feb 2025)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eed245ddd0e7c1a6a79129e7fddbf28a0\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/sop-flexibility-framework-circular.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSOP for implementation of SEBI Circular SEBI/HO/AFD/AFD-PoD-2/P/CIR/2024/77\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e dated June 05, 2024 regarding framework for providing flexibility to FPIs in dealing with their securities post expiry of their registration\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e4fcae6ece24134662e75ca1483ed4f00\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/sop-material-disclosures.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSOP for implementation of SEBI Circular SEBI/HO/AFD/AFD-PoD-2/P/CIR/2024/76\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e dated June 05, 2024 regarding disclosure of material changes by FPIs, framed by the CDSSF in consultation with SEBI (Updated SOP as on January 16, 2026)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e30e3365a668a12587fe3b689d3d8df7b\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/addl-disclosure-sop-odi-fpis.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSOP for implementation of SEBI Circular\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e dated December 17, 2024 regarding additional disclosure framework for Offshore Derivative Instruments (ODIs)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e83248d6f5209beb70f4a70111fa5b8ba\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/sop-gs-fpi.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSOP for implementation of SEBI Circular SEBI/HO/AFD/AFD-PoD-3/P/CIR/2025/127\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e dated September 10, 2025 regarding Ease of regulatory compliances for FPIs investing only in Government Securities, framed by the CDSSF in consultation with SEBI. (Updated SOP as of 12th Feb 2026)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ebaf6c0d3b562ff026449f42fbbb9b6d8\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/securities-services.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eLearn more about Details of Various Services Charges\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee6fb23c1cfa9f218e07b6bbf5ac5a853\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/reporting-formats.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here for the SEBI Reporting formats for below reports\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e2818e6e49e6a35ee0c48010771d12d13\"\u003eFPI General Information to assess the eligibility under Regulation 4 of FPI Regulations, 2019\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e38e7979fc3656095057910dfe1c8c9b2\"\u003eNRI/OCI/RI requirements under Clause 1(ii) of Part A of Master Circular for FPIs and DDPs dated May 30, 2024\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e871e50dddde710a445390dc10ea6ad54\"\u003eChange in material information where there is a delay in intimation of more than 7 working days for Type I Material change \u0026amp; 30 calendar days for Type II Material change and or supporting document submission delay exceeding 30 calendar days for both Type I and Type II Material change from effective date of change as provided under Para 14 of Part A of the Master Circular for FPIs and DDPs\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e9bd713ee6c561e6c34d1bdbbe88e94be\"\u003eFPIs non-compliant with Legal entity identifier requirements under circular dated July 27, 2023\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e867d5187dc9ab2d97f4d1c7f23ccb729\"\u003eFPIs who have not submitted granular BO details under circular dated August 24, 2023\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e64f40e0a7825e37b05196bb21758ea2f\"\u003eFPIs granted exemption under circular dated August 24, 2023\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ebfaee22c1e6da961886a6731d8621516\"\u003eSEBI has recently launched New Investor website which offers valuable insights that can empower the general public to become informed and savvy investor. Investors can access the website through following link:\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://investor.sebi.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ehttps://investor.sebi.gov.in/\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"border-radius:10px;\" src=\"/rcs/v1/media/citigpa/akpublic/storage/retrieveMediaFile/67c02116390aa655e49fbe2b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"690\" height=\"393\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"table\"\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e4013ee72dfe908c1483a03dac0500c1a\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/sop-fpi-registration.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eStandard Operation Procedures (SOP) for FPI Registration\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee9f4243d8f6979672f18130efb99c421\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/swagat-fi.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eStandard Operation Procedures (SOP) for SWAGAT FI\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003col style=\"list-style-type:lower-latin;\"\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"efc7361f32abaa7a0853f7f124352e952\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/fpi-india-access-pack.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eFPI India Access Pack\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003col style=\"list-style-type:lower-roman;\"\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e80d9ca91f24dd7d4cca9adfa4afb44b8\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/caf-2026.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCommon Application Form (CAF)\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e9fc48ccc6632c1a853df7ce55dc4ede9\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/annexure-to-caf.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eAnnexure to CAF\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e2cce8d3a70783e2b3f1a21c071894f97\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/cover-letter-document-legal-entity.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCover Letter and Document for Legal Entity\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e82601f826b46dfba37f370b3cfff7026\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/declaration-additional-disclosures.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eDeclaration for additional disclosures\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eeb31720d54a52f4b059c7a2236e67350\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/facility-clients-kyc-status-kra-website.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eFacility for clients to view their KYC Status on KRA Website(s)\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ef8751bf9e42ca61256bcb4d6097c8574\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/investor-awareness-regarding-cybersecurity-risks.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eInvestor awareness regarding Cybersecurity risks\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComplaints Status\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e9e47dc9fc3a7ad0e010057b8fd7d4f38\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/complaints-against-custodians-sebi.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSEBI : Complaints against Custodians\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee03be9a04962c731abe915bfbf0fb1dd\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/complaints-against-depository-participants.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eNSDL/CDSL : Complaints against Depository Participant (DP)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e18eb71123788e0d1dd344582403848d3\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/complaints-against-designated-depository-participants-sebi.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSEBI : Complaints against Designated Depository Participants (DDPs)\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eINVESTOR CHARTER\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e6b44f26f11037ce2668527ff5f6be9ab\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/Investor-charter-custodians-designated-depository-participants.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eInvestor Charter for Custodians and Designated Depository Participants (DDPs)\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ec42d4d9299d233c722156a6457dc451a\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/custody-services/investor-charter-depository-participants.pdf\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eInvestor Charter for Depository Participants (DPs)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e"},{"file":[{"title":""}],"title":"Manage Financial Risks","type":"richText","richText":"\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIdentify Risk\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery business is exposed to financial risks on various fronts depending on the nature of the underlying business and the business borrowing. At Citi, we follow a strategic approach to manage your financial risks. The first step is identifying all risks that can impact your revenues and profitability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInterest rate risk:\u003c/strong\u003e If your business has debt on its balance sheet, fluctuations in interest rates can impact profitability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eForeign exchange risk:\u003c/strong\u003e If your business has overseas trade operations, you are likely to be exposed to foreign exchange risk arising from currency volatility.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCommodity risk:\u003c/strong\u003e Fluctuations in commodity prices can impact the cost of your raw materials.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOnce all exposures that have a direct and indirect impact on the earnings are identified, we will perform an impact analysis to prioritize key exposures.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuantify Risk\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuantifying the risk exposure using the relevant metric is the first, key step towards establishing a risk management framework.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn addition to the traditional measure VaR (Value at Risk), to quantify your firm's exposures to the changes in market factors under normal conditions, Citi also employs sophisticated tools such as CFaR (Cash Flow at Risk), and EaR (Earning at Risk) to factor in long-term cash flows. The final impact of risks on the company is examined from a holistic perspective, accounting for individual exposures, volatilities and cross-correlations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo make sure that you stay in control even in unforeseen events, we conduct comprehensive stress testing and scenario analysis.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSet Risk Strategy\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuantifying risk provides the base from which a risk strategy can be drawn up. Citi partners with you to help define your risk management strategy. We will give you all key inputs including:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e138bc66636cc6b58965eedf0e0c99e1b\"\u003eEarning performance of the company on expected and worst case scenarios given market movements\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e46be553c7ceed23e86e758b23d334267\"\u003eScenario analysis: considering possible future market conditions\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e5357f1fa38489a3615a42e010497333a\"\u003eCost-benefit analysis: hedging has to be cost-efficient\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou could adopt one of the following strategies:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ec961ba0c0cb176f7292122ed59f7da94\"\u003eKeep naked positions on exposures\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"edb89b317e629f17b043d75aec3732708\"\u003eHedge all your exposures all the time\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e15ee3bc5ea9ca4ee0a870292e3a89a0e\"\u003eStrike a balance between hedging specific exposure and leaving some unhedged.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe final decision is solely yours. We strongly advocate that you deliberate on the pros and cons of each approach and adopt a strategy that suits you best.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHedge\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eCiti is a dominant market player in fixed income, currencies, commodities and derivatives. Our experienced sales professionals endeavor to understand the dynamics of your industry. Our specialist structuring team can belt out a full range of solutions to best meet your needs. We make it a point to exploit natural hedges and partial hedges in your exposures so that hedging is cost-effective.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLeverage our unmatched structuring capabilities to devise innovative products to help you manage your exposures in line with your financial objectives.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eOurs is a true relationship based approach. Once the hedging solution is implemented, we do periodic reviews to keep your hedge effective at all times, we can assist you with dynamic hedging by periodically rebalancing positions.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"file":[{"title":""}],"title":"Foreign Exchange","type":"richText","richText":"\u003ch4\u003eTypes of products offered\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eaea022b8271dd08fc903cbe7284ff004\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpot and forward FX solutions:\u003c/strong\u003e Support dynamic hedging and best coverage for cross currencies.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e01e1288dc27607b7d3b83c446a599991\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA leading market maker in INR.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"edf7d15fdbaa96c5b13357d720cf373fb\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShort tenor options:\u003c/strong\u003e Market leader in G3 currency options.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e03c4a7fcf7c0dda4914c42edce4e2aa4\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRisk management solutions:\u003c/strong\u003e To minimize earnings volatility, manage transaction risks, protect business margins etc. for:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e2d5e065a71576bb773f3f7fb396db424\"\u003eIndian companies having currency exposure: export receivables, import payables, ECBs, EEFC balances etc.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e33c3b651fa5ff9f686d18a42f7b69918\"\u003eForeign entities: Customized solutions for M\u0026amp;As, FDIs, cash repatriations and intercompany lending to subsidiaries\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e7c80297f2b45aa40fc5a9cb8fbd2b135\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnline FX dealing platform:\u003c/strong\u003e Selectively offered basis type, volumes and frequency of FX transactions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003eCiti credentials and market share\u003c/h4\u003e\u003ch5\u003eMarket Penetration:\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e15d50090bcb95ddd443de769301b2d5b\"\u003eWith a base of \u003cstrong\u003eover 6000\u003c/strong\u003e clients, Citi is one of the largest foreign exchange banks in India.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ef3a5dbfc53a39faff5cca69f7a90ab4a\"\u003eCiti India FX market share is estimated to be one of the largest among all AD banks in India\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eOur Value Proposition\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e4f3bbf0ae67c3bbb76478328aa174cf0\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRegional and Local Expertise -\u003c/strong\u003e Ability to execute large ticket deals across Local Rates and FX markets. Largest single ticket FX executed for $2.3 billion\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e3fcd7e542ce3acfc4f1c4c257a15513b\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDiverse Client Base -\u003c/strong\u003e Serving a host of domestic and international clients for their onshore INR FX/Rates related solutions. Largest FX market share amongst foreign banks.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ef88cfef5db95b6da39b110c421e73894\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHolistic Product Suite -\u003c/strong\u003e Complete Product Suite of Vanilla and Structured solutions across FX, Rates, Commodities and Credit.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ea4f72f238f644fa46aee1f5840c21249\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDedicated \u0026amp; Experienced Team -\u003c/strong\u003e Global team of experienced professionals to provide tailored solutions to corporates. Client assured full confidentiality.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e0f6cf8127a4ed039b34a35f2b589280b\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLocal Markets Expertise -\u003c/strong\u003e Ability to manage entire end-to-end process and handle regulatory matters. Strong working relationship with regulators (RBI/SEBI)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003ePioneering initiatives undertaken\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e4ea182e5363acd6e40976a5bc5c5bad9\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCentralized treasury: \u003c/strong\u003eEnhanced capability to service clients given centralized coverage of countrywide flows.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e8393ba81bf71c295868c7b51883d9421\"\u003ePioneering new products such as INR denominated hedging and NDDCs for corporate clients.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ec9e81d5dc2991893b98c0d887e46e5b2\"\u003eRisk management advisory and value-added analytics to aid hedging decisions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee1ee22d92f6b3e39c3b7b3f3d6789a0e\"\u003eOne of the largest array of nostro currencies supported for cross border transactions to help in transactional cost optimization.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003eKey benefits of dealing with Citi India\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e9a1105eebdba77edefaeb6369fd4f15d\"\u003eCiti India is a dominant player in corporate FX in India with one of the largest market shares in corporate FX for INR\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ec701ae5d34ea2753ebe6650be4611b9a\"\u003eHas a focus on providing \u003cstrong\u003einnovative and customized FX hedging \u0026amp;\u003c/strong\u003e payments linked solutions to clients.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eeb76b2c14e3977754f398e7cecccdc3b\"\u003eSuperior product and service offering:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eb634249de5e3e8f982ce2d68a9494772\"\u003eCompetitive pricing: We have the ability to quote competitively, owing to our large book size.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e1625b57891bf5628f58f9a37f936a2d7\"\u003eMulti-currency capability\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e7d272a356509eeb19c1d96789dce19e6\"\u003eInnovative solutions\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e2d40bac67ba720be14456632005c03bd\"\u003eSelective extended FX deadlines: Extended deadlines to support FX execution for time sensitive transactions due to risk taking capabilities beyond market hours.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003eContacts\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ec33971278904a52e6d6cbe3cfa56e45c\"\u003eManoj Goel, Managing Director \u0026amp; Head, Corporate Sales and Solutions: \u003ca href=\"mailto:rahul2.arora@citi.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003emanoj.goel@citi.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ea66f9c65d479e68eb0be4440ac31b5f9\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:treasury.clientservices@citi.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003etreasury.clientservices@citi.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e; +91 22 6175 5400/6175 5500\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/forex-rates.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-source=\"tiny\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eForex Rates\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},{"file":[{"title":""}],"title":"List Of Unclaimed Deposits \u0026 Accounts","type":"richText","richText":"\u003cp\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;We refer to Reserve Bank of India’s circulars dated June 6, 2012 reference RBI/2011-12/591 DBOD.No.Leg.BC.108/09.07.005/2011-12; and RBI/2013-14/614 DBOD.No.DEAF Cell.BC.114/30.01.002/2013-14. As per these guidelines banks are required to display the list of unclaimed deposits/inoperative accounts which are inactive / inoperative for ten years or more on their respective websites. This is with a view of enabling the public to search the list of accounts by name of the company. Accordingly, please find below the names of such customers along with the signatory details and address available on our records.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e203c94f597a241222b105319fa7de338\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/inoperative-accounts-retail-customers.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – Retail Customers\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – Retail Customers.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eaaa7341f023e1d61930501775561c2e4\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/List-of-Unclaimed-Deposit-Accounts.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – Corporate Customers\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – Corporate Customers.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"edd6d8548de16e9ef9dd652aebe78abca\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/List-of-Unclaimed-Accounts-Cards.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click here for details of Unclaimed / Inoperative Accounts – Credit Card Customers\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here for details of Unclaimed / Inoperative Accounts – Credit Card Customers.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e77c0f0608725716ff19bebbc2995dab7\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/Securities-Services-Issuer-Services.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – Securities Services and Issuer Services.\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – Securities Services and Issuer Services.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e9465c6f2a3801c3ff6f7d5edaf3f40fd\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/term-deposits.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts - Term Deposits.\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts - Term Deposits.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"edce08a793e455d0bf90f3e4425ae268a\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/tts-payment-operation.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – TTS Payment Operation\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – TTS Payment Operation.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e3ca20f7d7023c52730c415fd8243b173\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/tts-commercial-cards.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click here for details of Unclaimed Deposits - TTS Commercial Cards\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here for details of Unclaimed Deposits - TTS Commercial Cards.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e4635f6152bfe4d110ae37487d3b2f4b7\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/tts-trade-operations.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – TTS Trade Operations\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eClick here for details of Unclaimed Deposits / Inoperative Accounts – TTS Trade Operations.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ea5189efae08f25731ee368c2c191041c\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/demat-investor-charter.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Demat Investor Charter\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eDemat Investor Charter\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor ICG / Corporate Customers:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/unclaimed-deposits-accounts-for-icg-and-corporate-customers.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Inoperative account activation process guide\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eInoperative account activation process guide\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTo activate your Account, please reach us at,\u003cbr\u003ePhone: 91-22-6784 3555, 91-22-6784 3666, 91-22-4321 3500,\u003cbr\u003eToll Free number: 1800 102 3626,\u003cbr\u003eE-mail: \u003ca href=\"mailto:india.citiservice@citi.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eindia.citiservice@citi.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor GCG/ Retail Customers:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/customer-services/gcg-retail-unclaimed-deposits-claims.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Unclaimed deposits claim process guidelines\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eUnclaimed deposits claim process guidelines\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eTo claim back your unclaimed deposits funds, please reach us at,\u003cbr\u003eE-mail: \u003ca href=\"mailto:serviceindia@citi.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eserviceindia@citi.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},{"file":[{"title":""}],"title":"Disclosure Documents","type":"richText","richText":"\u003ch4\u003eCitibank NA Markets: FX and Interest Rate Derivative Documents\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e2614e695470ae60ecf742f11bfb2ba0c\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/market-product-disclosure-stmt/all-derivatives.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Product Disclosure Statement - Derivatives\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eProduct Disclosure Statement - Derivatives\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e"},{"file":[{"document":[],"title":""}],"title":"Commodities","type":"richText","richText":"\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMarkets - Fixed Income, Currencies, Commodities, Equities.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCommodities.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003ch5\u003eTypes of products offered\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e684d7ffe95e24cd21cb5a09b642bc489\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRisk management solutions:\u003c/strong\u003e The primary focus of the commodity desk is to synthesize risk management solutions for corporates to minimize earnings volatility, manage transaction risks and protect budgeted rates.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eCiti through its various branches outside of India, offers:\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e97732fac05b297ff1eaac8481ad74f88\"\u003eOver-the-counter (OTC) products and\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e7682fcef45bccea3d748acde27380097\"\u003eExchange Traded products\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee63da1ca1458a36ec1409c3eb2c36d2c\"\u003eStructured Commodity Financing Solutions\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eThe product offerings are on various underlying, including:\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee88e361315b04ca277aae6ff93f632fe\"\u003eEnergy products (crude oil, and refined products, LNG)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e5b1cd20dbacd9f1cef3f8af9b542ef4f\"\u003eBase and ferrous metals (Aluminium, Copper, Zinc, Nickel, Tin, Lead, Steel, Iron Ore)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e506d9ce9de9896c2f76e56c60b9d54ff\"\u003ePrecious Metals (Gold, Silver, Platinum, Palladium)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e89cb51951ce22940c1c932b7cbf9d82f\"\u003eSoft and Agri commodities\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e90db02c5f6e5b4108e7a10e8d40ad2da\"\u003eCarbon Credits\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e2c82b812de1212542e99ad4247015056\"\u003eFreight derivatives\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eCiti credentials, awards and market share\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e228d774f6bca4dd037631e944658fc51\"\u003eDerivatives house of the year, Asia - Energy Risk Asia Awards 2017\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e0793a19bc58c70323bd8ea027dd6c2be\"\u003eTop 5 commodities bank ranked by coalition\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003ePioneering initiatives undertaken\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e5091e003a3f805a4cc851e5fe0dfbd29\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated offering:\u003c/strong\u003e We offer an entire range of services/products under one roof. A single customer interface helps us understand customer needs better and enables us to deliver appropriate and efficient solutions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e874b7489868ee8faed905576500d50e3\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStructured products offering:\u003c/strong\u003e We have a dedicated desk working on specialised structured products for complicated/multi-dimensional transactions ensuring optimal value delivery.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eKey benefits of dealing with Citi India\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e8eecd5a709ae289885d14be08cf19099\"\u003eCiti is a major player in the Commodity Derivatives business in India.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ee9808be71284184c841d5924282c24be\"\u003eOur focus is on delivering value through innovative solutions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e1e5faad72fa9c000786d830ed82c194a\"\u003eWe establish enduring relationships with customers by being a partner in their commodity risk management initiative. We\u003cul style=\"list-style:none;\"\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e75e7f76904f85c425f1139382a72961f\"\u003e- Partnered with Air India on their first jet fuel transaction\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ed3f3b24f47515ea21e0de4d2a68cb703\"\u003e- Partnered with Jet Airways on their first jet fuel transaction\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e38a18e7f461884403cc3f597042b11ed\"\u003e- Partnered with BPCL on their first crack hedging transaction\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eContacts\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"edf82cbeee94d78dd685438b2f5b270d3\"\u003eRahul Arora, Managing Director \u0026amp; Head, Corporate Sales and Solutions: \u003ca href=\"mailto:rahul2.arora@citi.com\" title=\"rahul2.arora@citi.com\"\u003er\u003cu\u003eahul2.arora@citi.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e"},{"file":[{"title":""}],"title":"Derivatives","type":"richText","richText":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:22px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMarkets - Fixed Income, Currencies, Commodities, Equities.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:22px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDerivatives.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003eTypes of products and services offered\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eda3e929608621c88964bb9978612f444\"\u003eFull-service derivatives capabilities across risk classes - interest rates, commodities, currencies, credit and equities - on underlying markets around the world.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ea2daaf6c1103338e4144bc13495b3037\"\u003eStructured Products capabilities to help clients minimize capital raising costs, hedge or diversify market exposures, customize investment returns and access international markets.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"efcde9b737b36e4766f92b80b477a964e\"\u003eRisk management analyses for balance sheet, accounting and hedging purposes using proprietary models.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch4\u003eCiti credentials, awards and market share\u003c/h4\u003e\u003ch5\u003eDerivatives Week\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003eSeptember 2013\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e133b1f8711235382d020de1faf73870e\"\u003eGlobal Derivatives House of the Year\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ec44e05576e2b797d668df7c4fd1e7b00\"\u003eFX Derivatives House of the Year\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e17cdea87afdf36b453150b0ef9ab1777\"\u003eFX Platform of the Year - CitiVelocity\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eGlobal Finance Derivatives Awards\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003eOctober 2012\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e39c5732a838a6612dfd3c2548e12b785\"\u003eBest Bank for FX Derivatives\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e1bb5024c8ddb55b738d77521b8183a09\"\u003eBest Bank for Latin America Derivatives\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eRisk Interdealer Rankings\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003eSeptember 2012\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e47abded215b463f95e8da89058a830e0\"\u003eBest Bank for FX Swaps\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e58843b542b1003ff00cf18ae451344d4\"\u003eBest Bank for USD/EUR\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003ePioneering initiatives undertaken\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ebe5dfaf7a229d16ae613ea86a4abf752\"\u003eStructured solutions for raising capital through debt, equity or hybrid instruments in on-shore and off-shore capital markets.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e834096bbabf6f5e18be9635c14157ffd\"\u003eDistribution of Customized Investment Products.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ecc3493a8afbb24fa27c2ab588d479ca6\"\u003eRisk analytics capabilities in place.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eKey benefits of dealing with Citi India\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eaa79de548ad07e2d29e50db797b987fb\"\u003eCiti is one of the most active market-makers with an ability to provide innovative solutions across asset classes, backed by a senior coverage team.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e46fd3df275526b91ce8d9d1766452059\"\u003eCiti leverages a global network to make available best in class risk management practices to our clients and enables Indian clients to benefit from this global expertise.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eKey contacts\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e5b75acf50d2cee581e13a18c7bd9c034\"\u003eRahul Arora, Managing Director \u0026amp; Head, Corporate Sales and Solutions: \u003ca href=\"mailto:rahul2.arora@citi.com\" title=\"rahul2.arora@citi.com\"\u003e\u003cu\u003erahul2.arora@citi.com\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003eInvestor Charter\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003eNote:- Please note that CitiBank NA, is a Trading member of National Stock Exchange of India Limited (NSE), i.e. Settlement \u0026amp; Margin related activities (including Issuance of Annual Global Statement) are part of Clearing Member Responsibilities.\u003c/p\u003e"}],"businessLine":[{"code":"Banking","id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f71d"},{"code":"Markets","id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f71e"},{"code":"Services","id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f71f"}],"leadership":["67f537397926f351d38d657c"],"locationDetails":[{"detail":"\u003cp\u003eSubhayu Mishra\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCiti India Public Affairs Officer\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:Subhayu.mishra@citi.com\"\u003eSubhayu.mishra@citi.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Media"},{"detail":"\u003cp\u003eFirst International Financial Centre,\u003cbr\u003ePlot Nos C-54 and C-55, G-Block,\u003cbr\u003eBandra Kurla Complex,\u003cbr\u003eBandra East, Mumbai 400098.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Addresses"},{"detail":"\u003cul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.dicgc.org.in/\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eDICGC\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://udgam.rbi.org.in/unclaimed-deposits/#/login\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eUDGAM\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.dicgc.org.in/\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:252/255;border-radius:10px;width:25%;\" src=\"/rcs/v1/media/citigpa/akpublic/storage/retrieveMediaFile/67d8883dc9ed0b600dfee82a.png\" alt=\"Deposit Insurance and credit guarantee corporation home\" width=\"252\" height=\"255\" sstyle=\"aspect-ratio:252/255;border-radius:10px;width:25%;\"\u003e \u0026nbsp;\u003cimg class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:252/255;border-radius:10px;width:25%;\" src=\"/rcs/v1/media/citigpa/akpublic/storage/retrieveMediaFile/67d8883da6ff5b4906b1d397.PNG\" alt=\"Scan QR code to visit Deposit Insurance and credit guarantee corporation home\" width=\"252\" height=\"255\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","title":""}],"localizedList":[{"code":"en-US","name":"English","url":"https://www.citigroup.com/global/about-us/global-presence/india"}],"region":"Asia Pacific","enableExternalLandingPage":true,"allowedDomainList":["india"],"logo":{"theme":"shortDescription"},"notice":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ci data-olk-copy-source=\"MailCompose\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDear Customer,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis is with reference to the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) circular - Migration to '.bank.in' domain (dated Apr 22, 2025) to enhance security and trust in digital banking. In reference to the same, we wish to update you that the Bank is currently in the process of migrating its website and applications to the ‘.bank.in’ domain.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat does this mean for you –\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-italic\" data-list-item-id=\"ea439594a6a9bef7c985451ecbd9899f2\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan role=\"presentation\"\u003eUntil the migration is complete, \u003cstrong\u003eit is crucial that you ONLY use\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;the verified links provided below for all your banking needs. Please ensure you always access our services through these official channels to maintain the security of your account.'\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e4aacd035a78fc8ea6837a2e5b8d7ce71\"\u003eCitiDirect \u003ca href=\"https://www.citidirect.com/\"\u003ehttps://www.citidirect.com/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e44957574597c918d5ed3055155ff1f13\"\u003eCitiFX Pulse \u003ca href=\"https://www.citifxpulse.com\"\u003ehttps://www.citifxpulse.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e9b19120fb68179290d57c2b5e365659c\"\u003eCitiDirect Mobile \u003ca href=\"https://m.citidirect.com/\"\u003ehttps://m.citidirect.com/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e0eff3aa503b36aab170cd83ce92f8b3e\"\u003eCiti Velocity \u003ca href=\"https://www.citivelocity.com\"\u003ehttps://www.citivelocity.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eeef74157fe249a826bfcbbb9eadfa90d\"\u003eCiti Manager \u003ca href=\"https://home.cards.citidirect.citi.bank.in/CommercialCard/login\"\u003ehttps://home.cards.citidirect.citi.bank.in/CommercialCard/login\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"eaff8c34ed6d385030e153ce2cf776160\"\u003eCDCB\u003col\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e1ce16a26522427e607516bc35910da95\"\u003eFor Digital Onboarding: \u003ca href=\"https://commercialbanking.citidirect.com/\"\u003ehttps://commercialbanking.citidirect.com/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"ec7c09163166aa68fb0ff3ecfa9146f3d\"\u003eFor Everyday Banking: \u003ca href=\"https://citidirect.com/commercialbanking\"\u003ehttps://citidirect.com/commercialbanking\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"edec11f4d1cbf52d360a86d56605017a6\"\u003eCorporate website \u003ca href=\"https://www.citigroup.com/global/about-us/global-presence/india\"\u003ehttps://www.citigroup.com/global/about-us/global-presence/india\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list-item-id=\"e637e700d530e402e6bfde345ad90e226\"\u003eSFTS \u003ca href=\"https://webui.filetransfer.com\"\u003ehttps://webui.filetransfer.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-italic\" data-list-item-id=\"e2d8d0feccd504b738a09fedab4333c8a\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan role=\"presentation\"\u003eYour Internet Banking login ID and password remain the same.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"ck-list-marker-italic\" data-list-item-id=\"e76758776040c2e6a374642366b4ddc6c\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan role=\"presentation\"\u003eFor any queries, please reach out to your Customer Service/ Relationship Managers.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUpon successful migration by the Bank to the ‘\u003cstrong\u003e.bank.in\u003c/strong\u003e’ domain, we will reach out to you again with the revised links to the website and applications.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","locationMenu":{"menu":[{"name":"Citicorp Finance (India) Limited","link":{"url":"/global/about-us/global-presence/india/cfil"}},{"name":"CGM India Private Limited","link":{"url":"/global/about-us/global-presence/india/cgm-india"}},{"name":"Regulatory Disclosures - Citi India Investment Banking","link":{"url":"/global/about-us/global-presence/india/disclaimer"}},{"name":"Citibank N.A. – IBU","link":{"url":"/global/about-us/global-presence/india/citibank-na-ibu"}},{"name":"Raise a Complaint","link":{"url":"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/citi-india-raise-a-complaint.pdf"}},{"name":"Raise a Complaint - Legacy Consumer Business","link":{"id":"69c4091e8fb6ba4b26c7f7b1","url":"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/raise-a-complaint-complaints-legacy-franchise-business.pdf"}},{"name":"Complaints Flow Chart","link":{"id":"69c504c68fb6ba4b26c7fa56","url":"/rcs/citigpa/storage/public/India/complaint-escalation-flowchart.pdf"}}],"title":"Quick Links"},"redirectTitle":"","redirectDescription":"","noticeTitle":"Migration to '.bank.in' domain","seo":[{"key":"title","value":"India | Citi Global Presence"}]},"languages":null,"orderIndex":null,"videoPublisher":null,"mediaSrc":null,"templateId":null,"everPub":true,"modifiedGmt":"2026-06-17T20:52:04.640+00:00","version":80},"67f537397926f351d38d657c":{"id":"67f537397926f351d38d657c","originalId":null,"tags":[],"type":"gpaPeople","subType":null,"businessId":"k-balasubramanian","title":"K Balasubramanian","content_json":{"businessType":["GPA"],"role":["Author"],"displayName":"K Balasubramanian","firstName":"K","lastName":"Balasubramanian","jobTitle":"India Subcontinent Sub-Cluster \u0026 Banking Head and India CEO \u0026 Banking Head","region":"Asia Pacific","image":"67f537227926f351d38d6578","thumbnailImage":"67f537227926f351d38d6578","localizedList":[{"code":"en-US","name":"English","url":"https://www.citigroup.com/global/about-us/leadership/k-balasubramanian"}]},"languages":null,"orderIndex":null,"videoPublisher":null,"mediaSrc":null,"templateId":null,"everPub":null,"modifiedGmt":"2025-04-09T03:52:26.288+00:00","version":1},"Preferences":[{"id":"638f1862d11f9234a9b87602","siteId":"citigpa","type":"Preferences","code":"News","name":"News","taxonomy_json":null,"languages":null,"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"638f1863d11f9234a9b87604","siteId":"citigpa","type":"Preferences","code":"SEC Filings","name":"SEC Filings","taxonomy_json":null,"languages":null,"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"63c2049e29c4182f4e700c1f","siteId":"citigpa","type":"Preferences","code":"Perspectives","name":"Perspectives","taxonomy_json":null,"languages":null,"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null}],"businessLine":[{"id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f71d","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Banking","name":"Banking","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Banking listens, collaborates and problem solves, working tirelessly on behalf of our corporate, financial institution, public sector and sponsor clients to deliver a range of strategic corporate finance and advisory solutions that meet their needs, no matter how complex.","link":"/global/businesses/banking","linkText":"Learn More"},"languages":{"es-MX":{"name":"BANCA","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Contamos con tres líneas de negocio - Banca Corporativa, Banca de Inversión y Banca Comercial- para brindar una oferta completa de productos entre los que destacan emisiones de deuda y acciones en los mercados de capital, crédito, capital de trabajo y operaciones de comercio exterior, entre otros. Nuestros clientes -corporaciones, gobiernos, instituciones financieras y compañías medianas en expansión internacional de diferentes industrias– se benefician de nuestra red sin paralelo que les conecta con más de 180 países, en 95 de los cuales Citi tiene presencia física.","link":"/global/businesses/banking","linkText":"\u003cspan lang='en'\u003eLearn More\u003c/span\u003e"}},"zh-CN":{"name":"企业与机构客户银行服务","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"花旗为企业、金融机构、公共部门及其他客户提供一系列战略性企业融资和咨询解决方案。我们凭借独一无二的全球网络，将跨国企业引入中国，并助力中国企业出海。花旗全球的网络和服务助力超过300家中国领先企业走向全球。我们还支持许多快速成长的中型企业，并为70%的财富500强企业提供服务。","link":"/global/businesses/banking","linkText":"更多"}}},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f71e","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Markets","name":"Markets","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Markets provides world-class solutions and an unmatched global presence. We serve corporates, institutional investors and governments from trading floors in almost 80 countries.","link":"/global/businesses/markets","linkText":"Learn More"},"languages":{"zh-TW":{"name":"金融市場","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"我們為客戶提供世界級解決方案和領先業界的全球網絡，在全球近80個國家為企業、機構投資人及政府單位提供交易服務。","link":"/global/businesses/markets","linkText":"更多"}},"es-MX":{"name":"\u003cspan lang='en'\u003eMARKETS\u003c/span\u003e","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Provee soluciones de clase mundial y una presencia global sin igual. Servimos a corporaciones, inversores institucionales y gobiernos desde nuestros pisos de negociación en casi 80 países. La fortaleza de nuestra suscripción, ventas y nuestra capacidad transaccional y de distribución a través de diferentes clases ((Commodities, Equities, Rates, Spread Products) y monedas, nos habilita para cubrir las necesidades de nuestros clientes. Conoce más","link":"/global/businesses/markets","linkText":"\u003cspan lang='en'\u003eLearn More\u003c/span\u003e"}},"zh-CN":{"name":"金融市场服务","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"金融市场服务凭借花旗在全球无与伦比的网络优势为客户提供业界领先的解决方案。我们在近 80 个国家和地区的交易所为企业、机构投资者和政府提供服务，我们的承销、销售、交易和分销能力涵盖各资产类别（商品、股票、利率、价差产品）和汇率，以满足不同的客户需求。","link":"/global/businesses/markets","linkText":"更多"}}},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f71f","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Services","name":"Services","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Services is a key operational partner for clients, helping them grow and become more efficient. From global integrated cash management, working capital and trade finance solutions for corporations, FIs and public sector entities to custody, fund administration, middle office, securities lending and Issuer Services to FIs, investors and issuers.","link":"/global/businesses/services"},"languages":{"es-MX":{"name":"SERVICIOS","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Soluciones de Tesorería y Comercio Exterior Las nuevas tecnologías nos abren nuevas oportunidades para servir a nuestros clientes, TTS (Soluciones de Tesorería y Comercio Exterior) invierte en innovación para dar vida a nuevas soluciones estableciendo un futuro digital a partir de un sólido legado y una red única de soluciones comerciales globales. Como podemos ayudarlo Canales digitales y data Tarjetas Corporativas Administración de liquidez Pagos Cobranza Comercio Internacional","link":"/global/businesses/services","linkText":"\u003cspan lang='en'\u003eLearn More\u003c/span\u003e"}},"zh-CN":{"name":"财资与贸易金融及证券服务","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"财资与贸易金融及证券服务是企业运营的好伙伴，呵护企业成长并提高其运营效率。服务涵盖了为企业、金融机构和公共部门提供的全球综合现金管理、营运资金和贸易融资解决方案，以及为金融机构、投资者和发行人提供托管、基金管理、中台、证券借贷和发行人服务。","link":"/global/businesses/services","linkText":"更多"}}},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f720","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Wealth Management","name":"Citi Global Wealth","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Global Wealth Management brings together the full power of Citi to serve the entire continuum of wealth clients, from affluent to ultra-high net worth to family offices.","link":"/global/businesses/citi-global-wealth","linkText":"Learn More"},"languages":{},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f721","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Commercial Bank","name":"Commercial Bank","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"We help mid-sized companies with revenues starting from $10MM USD address the challenges of rapid growth and international expansion by rationalizing complicated legacy setups or allowing clients to avoid them altogether, so that they can scale faster and grow larger.","link":"/global/businesses/banking/commerical-bank","linkText":"Learn More"},"languages":{"zh-TW":{"name":"花旗商業金融在全球","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"我們協助營收在一千萬美元以上之企業解決在快速成長及國際擴張過程中所面臨的挑戰，處理既有或避免衍生新的財務問題，驅動企業加速成長。","link":"/global/businesses/banking/commerical-bank","linkText":"更多"}}},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f722","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"TTS","name":"TTS","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Our treasury services help optimize the needs of our clients on a global scale. Treasury and Trade Solutions provides global solutions that can help clients drive their business forward while investing in innovation to bring new solutions to life.","link":"https://www.icg.citi.com/icghome/what-we-do/treasury-and-trade-solutions","linkText":"Learn More"},"languages":{},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f723","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Treasury and Trade Solutions","name":"Treasury and Trade Solutions","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Our treasury services help optimize the needs of our clients on a global scale. Treasury and Trade Solutions provides global solutions that can help clients drive their business forward while investing in innovation to bring new solutions to life.","link":"/global/businesses/services/treasury-and-trade-solutions","linkText":"Learn More"},"languages":{"zh-TW":{"name":"貿易解決方案","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"我們以環球視野提供客戶資金管理產品與服務，跨越國界的解決方案協助客戶在追求業務成長之際也能投資創新的未來。","link":"/global/businesses/services/treasury-and-trade-solutions","linkText":"更多"}}},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"638f18a0c58dfb12e021f724","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"U.S. Personal Banking","name":"U.S. Personal Banking","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"U.S. Personal Banking includes branded cards, retail services, and retail banking, and serves our home market, which has the largest consumer wallet in the world.","link":"/global/businesses/us-personal-banking","linkText":"Learn More"},"languages":{"es-MX":{"name":"\u003cspan lang='en'\u003eCITI PRIVATE BANK\u003c/span\u003e ","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Dedicados a server a los individuos de mayor riqueza y sus familias. Ofrecemos nuestros servicios a clientes de valor ultra alto en cerca de 100 naciones. Nuestros clientes incluyen emprendedores, líderes de negocios, ejecutivos y sus familias, a quienes ofrecemos servicios personalizados que les ayudan a proteger y crecer su patrimonio responsablemente. Nos enfocamos en menos clientes que son más grandes y sofisticados con valor mayor a 100 millones de dólares.","link":"/global/businesses/us-personal-banking","linkText":"\u003cspan lang='en'\u003eLearn More\u003c/span\u003e"}}},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"63b8cb992bfa165b20bcfb43","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"BCMA","name":"BCMA","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Citi's Banking, Capital Markets and Advisory division provides comprehensive relationship coverage and a full suite of products and services in an effort to be the best possible financial partner to its institutional clients.","link":"/global/businesses/banking/bcma","linkText":"Learn More"},"languages":{"zh-TW":{"name":"銀行、資本市場及財務顧問服務","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"我們提供完善的銀行、股權與債權資本市場及併購財務顧問的產品和服務，致力成為機構客戶最佳的財務夥伴。","link":"/global/businesses/banking/bcma","linkText":"更多"}}},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"63b8cbac2bfa165b20bcfb45","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Securities Services","name":"Securities Services","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"Securities Services supports our clients’  business by drawing on the strength of our unmatched global footprint, which provides them with access to local expertise and scalable solutions to support their ambitions.","link":"/global/businesses/services/securities-services","linkText":"Learn More"},"languages":{"zh-TW":{"name":"證券服務","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"我們運用領先業界的全球網絡為客戶提供全球各市場之深度在地專業及可規模化之解決方案，以支持客戶達成業務發展目標。","link":"/global/businesses/services/securities-services","linkText":"更多"}}},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"64d1aa1164a12a5a12f948f5","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Commercial Bank in Taiwan","name":"Commercial Bank in Taiwan","taxonomy_json":null,"languages":{"zh-TW":{"name":"花旗商業金融在台灣","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"我們支持企業客戶拓展業務版圖的雄心，憑藉無遠弗屆的環球網絡，提供全方位金融服務。我們密切掌握國際金融市場脈動，傾聽、了解台灣企業需求，與客戶建立緊密的夥伴關係，提供客製化與創新的金融解決方案，外匯與資金管理產品在國際評等上屢獲殊榮，可協助企業進行完善的資產配置與風險管理，達成財務與業務目標。","link":"/global/about-us/global-presence/zh-TW/taiwan/commercial-bank-in-taiwan","linkText":"更多"}}},"createdBy":null,"createdGmt":null},{"id":"6a03e0bb3fa03600a00a2f17","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"banking-kw","name":"Banking-Kuwait","taxonomy_json":null,"languages":{"ar-KW":{"name":"الخدمات المصرفية (Banking)","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"تستمع الخدمات المصرفية وتتعاون وتحل المشكلات، وتعمل بلا كلل نيابة عن عملائنا من الشركات والمؤسسات المالية والقطاع العام والجهات الراعية لتقديم مجموعة من حلول التمويل المؤسسي والاستشارات الاستراتيجية التي تلبي احتياجاتهم مهما كانت معقدة.","link":"/global/businesses/banking/commerical-bank","linkText":"تعرّف على المزيد"}}},"createdBy":"jj16188","createdGmt":"2026-05-13T02:23:55.230+00:00"},{"id":"6a03e127a46ee215bdaaa3ff","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Markets-kw","name":"Markets (Kuwait)","taxonomy_json":null,"languages":{"ar-KW":{"name":"الأسواق (Markets)","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"توفر الأسواق حلولاً عالمية المستوى وحضوراً عالمياً لا مثيل له. نحن نخدم الشركات والمؤسسات الإستثمارية والحكومات من خلال صالات التداول في ما يقرب من 80 دولة.","link":"/global/businesses/banking/commerical-bank","linkText":"تعرّف على المزيد"}}},"createdBy":"jj16188","createdGmt":"2026-05-13T02:25:43.132+00:00"},{"id":"6a03e1a607d4d93196e8f994","siteId":"citigpa","type":"businessLine","code":"Services-kw","name":"Services (Kuwait)","taxonomy_json":null,"languages":{"ar-KW":{"name":"الخدمات (Services)","taxonomy_json":{"summary":"تعد الخدمات شريكاً تشغيلياً رئيسياً للعملاء، حيث تساعدهم على النمو وأن يصبحوا أكثر كفاءة. من إدارة النقد العالمية المتكاملة، ورأس المال العامل وحلول تمويل التجارة للشركات والمؤسسات المالية وكيانات القطاع العام، إلى خدمات الحفظ، وإدارة الصناديق، والمكتب الأوسط، وإقراض الأوراق المالية، وخدمات المصدرين للمؤسسات المالية والمستثمرين والمصدرين.","link":"/global/businesses/banking/commerical-bank","linkText":"تعرّف على المزيد"}}},"createdBy":"jj16188","createdGm